(text "VSYS from BQ24074 powers boost. The two independent 4-LED strings each receive 19.97 mA with 63.4k at ISET." (at 16 114.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 45e1f51d-d574-5377-be4b-c200f52d8b30))
(text "EN follows filtered VIN. Native BL_PWM at 20 kHz sets brightness. Hold low through reset and panel initialization." (at 16 119.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 2a8c2e32-0f75-55db-aba4-06d23a2a5800))
(text "L601 4.7 uH. D601 band/cathode goes to LEDA. C603 2.2 uF / 50 V. C604 330 nF." (at 16 124.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 15bb5b75-d3db-5d68-a704-b113af369e0a))
(text "R602 10 ohms and C602 1 uF filter driver VIN. Keep the switching loop short and clear of microphone lines." (at 16 129.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid 26048941-38dd-5630-9171-3928587f0ec6))
